// Business connectors (business-connectors K9: Slack, Messenger, Instagram, the books, Zoho Mail and CRM, Resend, Brevo, Mailchimp). SYNTHETIC SEEDS PENDING REVIEW BY PEOPLE (needs-people AI2). Never copy into a prompt.
{"id":"conn-slack-paid-invoice-channel","request":"Post in our sales channel on Slack whenever a customer pays one of our invoices, saying who paid and how much.","expect":{"connectors":["slack@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"invoice","properties":["dedup"]},"tags":["connectors","slack","invoices"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-slack-evening-money","request":"At 7pm every day, give the finance channel in Slack a short summary of the money that came in and went out today.","expect":{"connectors":["slack@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"schedule"},"tags":["connectors","slack","reporting"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-slack-failed-supplier-payment","request":"If a payment to a supplier fails or the bank reverses it, warn the operations channel on Slack straight away with the reason and the amount.","expect":{"connectors":["slack@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"capability_event","properties":["dedup"]},"tags":["connectors","slack","payouts"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-instagram-closed-hours","request":"When someone sends our Instagram account a DM between 8pm and 8am, answer at once that the shop is closed and we will reply in the morning.","expect":{"connectors":["instagram@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["reply_in_window"]},"tags":["connectors","instagram","messaging"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-messenger-menu-question","request":"People keep asking our Facebook Page for the price list. When a message mentions prices or the menu, reply with the price list from our products table; anything else, leave for us.","expect":{"connectors":["messenger@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["reply_in_window"]},"tags":["connectors","messenger","messaging"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-messenger-new-chat-alert","request":"Tell the shop manager on WhatsApp whenever a new person starts a conversation with our Facebook Page, with the first thing they said.","expect":{"connectors":["messenger@1","notify@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["no_hardcoded_contacts"]},"tags":["connectors","messenger","notifications"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-instagram-dm-order-link","request":"When a customer orders in an Instagram DM and says the amount, make a payment link for it and send the link back in the same conversation.","expect":{"connectors":["instagram@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["reply_in_window"]},"tags":["connectors","instagram","collections"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-books-copy-every-invoice","request":"Every invoice we send from Taskiem should also be in our accounting software, under the same invoice number, with the customer added if they are new.","expect":{"connectors":["capability:books_invoice"],"steps":["capability"],"properties":["invoice_copied_once","books_by_capability"]},"tags":["connectors","books","invoices"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-books-quickbooks-invoices","request":"We use QuickBooks. Once a customer is billed, put the invoice into QuickBooks too, only once, and keep our invoice number on it.","expect":{"connectors":["capability:books_invoice"],"steps":["capability"],"properties":["invoice_copied_once","books_by_capability"]},"tags":["connectors","books","quickbooks"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-books-zoho-paid-payments","request":"When money arrives that settles one of our invoices, record that payment against the invoice in Zoho Books.","expect":{"connectors":["capability:books_payment"],"steps":["capability"],"properties":["books_by_capability"]},"tags":["connectors","books","reconciliation"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-books-school-fees-receipt","request":"At the close of each school day, put the fees we collected into the books as one sales receipt for the day.","expect":{"connectors":["capability:books_sale"],"steps":["capability"],"properties":["books_by_capability"]},"tags":["connectors","books","schools"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-books-copy-then-email","request":"Send the customer their invoice by SMS, then copy the same invoice into our books with its number.","expect":{"templates":["send-invoice","books-copy-invoice"],"properties":["invoice_copied_once","books_by_capability"]},"tags":["connectors","books","composition"],"difficulty":"hard"}
{"id":"conn-zoho-mail-paid-receipt","request":"Email the customer a receipt from our Zoho mailbox as soon as they pay an invoice.","expect":{"connectors":["zoho_mail@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"invoice"},"tags":["connectors","zoho_mail","invoices"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-zoho-mail-supplier-bills","request":"Suppliers email their bills to our accounts mailbox in Zoho Mail. Read each one, and once the finance lead approves it, record it as a bill in our books.","expect":{"connectors":["zoho_mail@1","capability:books_bill"],"steps":["approval","capability"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["books_by_capability","approval_timeout"]},"tags":["connectors","zoho_mail","books"],"difficulty":"hard"}
{"id":"conn-zoho-crm-storefront-deals","request":"Add the buyer of every storefront order to Zoho CRM as a contact, and open a deal for the order's total.","expect":{"connectors":["zoho_crm@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"storefront"},"tags":["connectors","zoho_crm","sales"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-zoho-crm-paid-won","request":"When a customer pays their invoice, mark their deal in Zoho CRM as won.","expect":{"connectors":["zoho_crm@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"invoice"},"tags":["connectors","zoho_crm","invoices"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-resend-invoice-email","request":"When an invoice is issued, email it to the customer through Resend from our billing address.","expect":{"connectors":["resend@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"invoice"},"tags":["connectors","resend","invoices"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-resend-bounced-receipts","request":"If one of our receipt emails bounces in Resend, mark that customer's email as not working in the customers table so we stop using it.","expect":{"connectors":["resend@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["dedup"]},"tags":["connectors","resend","data"],"difficulty":"medium"}
{"id":"conn-brevo-newsletter-box","request":"Put customers who ticked the newsletter box when they signed up onto our Brevo newsletter list, and nobody who didn't.","expect":{"connectors":["brevo@1"],"steps":["connector"],"properties":["opted_in_only"]},"tags":["connectors","brevo","marketing"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-mailchimp-agreed-customers","request":"Keep our Mailchimp audience up to date with the customers in our table who agreed to hear from us.","expect":{"connectors":["mailchimp@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["opted_in_only"]},"tags":["connectors","mailchimp","marketing"],"difficulty":"easy"}
{"id":"conn-mailchimp-win-back","request":"On the first of every month, find customers who said yes to marketing but have not bought anything in 60 days, add them to Mailchimp tagged win-back, and send the win-back campaign to that tag.","expect":{"connectors":["mailchimp@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["foreach","connector"],"trigger":"schedule","properties":["opted_in_only","bounded_concurrency"]},"tags":["connectors","mailchimp","marketing"],"difficulty":"hard"}
{"id":"conn-brevo-win-back","request":"Every Monday, put customers who opted in to marketing and have been quiet for 60 days on our Brevo win-back list, then send that list the comeback campaign.","expect":{"connectors":["brevo@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["foreach","connector"],"trigger":"schedule","properties":["opted_in_only","bounded_concurrency"]},"tags":["connectors","brevo","marketing"],"difficulty":"hard"}
{"id":"conn-mailchimp-unsubscribe-back","request":"When someone unsubscribes from our Mailchimp emails, switch off their marketing flag in the customers table.","expect":{"connectors":["mailchimp@1","xenibase@1"],"steps":["connector"],"trigger":"connector_event","properties":["dedup"]},"tags":["connectors","mailchimp","data"],"difficulty":"easy"}
